{"t":"Warsinger Bow","s":"warsinger-bow-6e1fc","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Warsinger_Bow_3ac036.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Warsinger Bow</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Warsinger Bow\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warsinger_Bow_3ac036.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">80</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">paladins</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hands\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hands</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Two</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"imbueslots\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Imbuing Slots</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgradeclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"range\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Range</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"atk_mod\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Atk Modifier</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hit_mod\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hit% Modifier</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">+5</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapons<br/>Distance Weapons<br/>Bows</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">45.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">400,000 - 1,000,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171004193415&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warsinger_Bow_3ac036.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a warsinger bow <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Range:7, Atk+3, Hit%+5)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot, Empty Slot, Empty Slot).<br/>Classification: 3 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by paladins of level 80 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 45.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This bow has a hit% of +5, and atk +3. The bow's hit% of +5 makes arrows incredibly accurate and with the new Crystalline Arrow introduced in Updates/9.6, calculations have shown that the bow is the second most effective Distance Weapons in the game after <a href=\"#/wiki/Mycological%20Bow\">Mycological Bow</a>, beating both <a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Crossbow\">Royal Crossbow</a> and Thorn Spitter on average damage per hit with regular ammunition (non-<a href=\"#/wiki/Infernal%20Bolt\">Infernal Bolt</a>). \n</p><p>To elaborate, the Crystalline Arrow has a significantly higher hit rate than its bolt counterpart, the Prismatic Bolt, but only slightly lower attack. The higher hit rate outperforms the extra potential damage that comes from using a crossbow.\n</p><p>The bonus range is also a welcome addition to any hunt as it allows you to start attacking creatures just as they enter the screen. It can also be useful in a narrow PvP-environment. \nObtainable in the <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Distance Extra Damage Auto-Attack\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110320&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Gain_Extra_Damage_Auto_Attack_099693.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+4% of your Distance Fighting as extra damage for auto-attacks</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Life Gain on Kill\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+10 hit points on kill</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Mana Gain on Kill\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+10 mana on kill</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Attack Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1 attack</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Perfect Shot Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+15 damage at range 7</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p clas